{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8add6006945d280a024","chatId":"7bbacbfa85824866bcdf455e07d4c94f","sessionId":null,"userId":68316,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":930,"promptTokens":1501,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035916185988022612,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8add6006945d280a021","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369709808,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8add6006945d280a021","chatId":"7bbacbfa85824866bcdf455e07d4c94f","sessionId":null,"userId":68316,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n多瑞在尝试制作蜜糖果仁千层酥， 当她从烤箱拿出来时， 发现千层酥制作失败了，面层不酥脆，内馅也炸出到盘子上。那时，她的女儿刚回到家，看到她母亲制作的新鲜但失败了的蜜糖果仁千层酥。她尝了一口，给母亲竖起一个大拇指。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，多瑞最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 生气\nC) 尴尬\nD) 绝望\nE) 自豪\nF) 失望\n\n## 问题 2\n多瑞为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的女儿想鼓励她，虽然不喜欢这次做的巴克拉瓦\nB) 尽管她不喜欢自己做的千层酥，她还是对女儿很喜欢它很惊喜\nC) 巴克拉瓦并未被毁掉\nD) 她的女儿刚刚回到家","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035916185988022612,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8add6006945d280a024","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369709805,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0cc4e9a1e653462eab5d2ce9699ff5c2"}